   "sourceHash": "cd2e5af0f446f0089b3c5a153ab9a383317895f3926ac1f5aa2a13ab48c4a21b",
   "text": "Terapeutas a espremer óleo de ervas morno das mãos sobre as pernas de um paciente",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
